  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><figure class=\"mw-halign-left\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/page/Category:Quiver_items\" title=\"Category:Quiver items\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_Item_Slot_Quiver.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Quiver_of_Alacrity\">Quiver of Alacrity</span></h2>\n<p><span style=\"background-color: initial; color: #FF0000;\"><span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: inherit;\"><i>This item cannot be fed to <a href=\"/page/Sentient_Weapon\" title=\"Sentient Weapon\">sentient jewels</a>.</i></span></span>\n</p>\n<table class=\"border-color-1\" style=\"clear: right; margin: 4px; border: 1px solid #EEBBEE; --bg-color-1:#DDA0DD;--bg-color-1-dark:#773777;--bg-color-2:#FFC2FF;--bg-color-2-dark:#4B224B;--border-color-1:#DDA0DD;--border-color-1-dark:#773777;\" width=\"100%\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color:#EEBBEE\" width=\"15%\">Minimum level\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color:#F0E4F0\" width=\"50%\">None\n</td>\n<th rowspan=\"11\" class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#F0E4F0\" width=\"35%\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Quiver_Generic_Alacrity.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Quiver_Generic_Alacrity.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"398\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color:#EEBBEE\">Item Type\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color:#F0E4F0\">Quiver / Thin Quiver\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color:#EEBBEE\">Binding\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color:#F0E4F0\"><a href=\"/page/Bind\" title=\"Bind\">Bound to Character&#160;on Acquire</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color:#EEBBEE\">Durability\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color:#F0E4F0\">N/A\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color:#EEBBEE\">Material\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color:#F0E4F0\"><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r705484\">.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip{cursor:pointer;position:relative}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip.no-icon{border-bottom:1px dashed #999999}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip>span.popup.tooltip{background-color:#EEEEEE;background-color:var(--background-color-neutral,#EEEEEE);border:1px solid #333333;border-radius:3px;box-shadow:3px 5px 10px;color:#202122;color:var(--color-base,#202122);cursor:text;display:none;margin:0px;max-width:500px;padding:5px;width:250px;z-index:10000}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.narrow{width:100px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.fill{padding:5px 12px;width:max-content}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.wide{width:450px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.custom{max-width:80vw}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip{display:block;position:absolute}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.above{bottom:100%;top:auto;margin-bottom:5px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.middle{bottom:auto;top:50%;margin-top:-1em}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.below{bottom:auto;top:100%;margin-top:5px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.left{left:0px;right:auto}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.center{left:50%;margin-left:-125px;right:auto}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.center.narrow{margin-left:-50px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.center.fill{left:-262px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;right:-262px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.center.wide{margin-left:-225px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.right{left:auto;right:0px}</style><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Category:No_Material_items\" title=\"Category:No Material items\">None</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Category:No_Material_items\" title=\"Category:No Material items\">None</a>:</b> There is no material defined for this item.  Quivers and cosmetic/store items have no listed material.</span></span> \n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color:#EEBBEE\">Hardness\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color:#F0E4F0\">N/A\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color:#EEBBEE\" width=\"150\">Base Value\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color:#F0E4F0\" width=\"450\">500 pp\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color:#EEBBEE\">Weight\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color:#F0E4F0\">1.00 lbs\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #EEBBEE\">Location\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #F0E4F0\"><b><a href=\"/page/Ascension_Chamber\" title=\"Ascension Chamber\">Ascension Chamber</a></b>, Raid Warded chest\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color:#EEBBEE\">Unique item capacity\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color:#F0E4F0\">\n<p>3\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color:#EEBBEE\">Max stack size\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color:#F0E4F0\">\n<p>1,500\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color:#EEBBEE\">Enchantments\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color:#F0E4F0\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Ranged_Alacrity\" title=\"Ranged Alacrity\">Ranged Alacrity 10%</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Ranged_Alacrity\" title=\"Ranged Alacrity\">Ranged Alacrity 10%</a>:</b> Gain 10% <a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">Enhancement bonus</a> to Ranged attack speed. Does not stack with the <a href=\"/page/Haste\" title=\"Haste\">Haste</a> spell.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Upgradeable_Item_(Black_Abbot)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Upgradeable Item (Black Abbot)\">Upgradeable Item (Black Abbot)</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/page/Upgradeable_Item_(Black_Abbot)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Upgradeable Item (Black Abbot)\">Upgradeable Item (Black Abbot)</a>: This item could be upgraded if you found a <a href=\"/page/Item:Seal_of_the_Black_Abbot\" title=\"Item:Seal of the Black Abbot\">Seal of the Black Abbot</a> to combine it with. Bring this item to the <a href=\"/page/Fountain_of_Necrotic_Might\" title=\"Fountain of Necrotic Might\">Fountain of Necrotic Might</a> outside the <a href=\"/page/Black_Mausoleum\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Black Mausoleum\">Black Mausoleum</a> and combine it with a Seal of the Black Abbot to upgrade the item to a more powerful form.</span></span>\n<ul><li>Adds <span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Striding\" title=\"Striding\">Striding +30%</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Striding\" title=\"Striding\">Striding +30%</a>:</b> This item makes you more fleet of foot, giving you a 30% Enhancement bonus your movement speed.</span></span></li></ul></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"3\" class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color:#F0E4F0\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Quiver_of_Alacrity.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Quiver_of_Alacrity.png/420px-Quiver_of_Alacrity.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"340\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Quiver_of_Alacrity.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color:#EEBBEE\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color:#F0E4F0\"><i>Said to allow the user to draw arrows or bolts at a very fast rate, this large, thin quiver will hold 3 different types of arrow or bolt and can store each type of up to 1500. Total capacity: 4500.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color:#EEBBEE\">Notes\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color:#F0E4F0\"><b>TIP:</b> This may cause your character overloaded because of the weight of bolts/arrows inside of the quiver when you are especially level-1 <b>(* 4,500 arrows are 135 lbs)</b>. Turning on the auto-collect function is not recommended. <br />\n<table class=\"collapsible\" style=\"margin-left: 20px; padding: 6px; padding-top: 0px; font-size: 0.9em; display: inherit;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"margin-bottom: 2px; text-align: left; font-weight:normal;\">Quote:\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border: 0.5px solid black;\">Originally Posted by <small>(former&#160;developer)</small>&#160;Feather_of_Sun <span class=\"mw-valign-text-top\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://forums-old.ddo.com/forums/showthread.php?p=4378420#post4378420\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Source\" src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Source_button.gif/10px-Source_button.gif\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Source_button.gif 1.5x\" /></a></span> <hr style=\"width: 95%; margin: 0px auto;\" />\n<p>I worked with Genasi to design the upgrades for the Abbot and Reaver's Fate loot. Though not all of my ideas went through in their original form, as this was a team effort, the upgrade to the Quiver of Alacrity is exactly how I intended it to be.\n</p><p>I know full well that it has no minimum level, and has never had one.\n</p><p>We're not planning on changing it, nor has the subject ever even come up.\n</p><p>The entire point of it is that the upgraded version of this item is a fantastic convenience to a TR who has put the work in to get and upgrade the quiver.\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260817224119\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.091 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.134 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3946/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 41149/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 11838/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 31/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2019/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 28/150\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n114.02%  133.639     49 Template:IO\n100.00%  117.212      1 Template:Named_item\n100.00%  117.212      1 -total\n 97.48%  114.260      1 Template:Quiver\n 37.32%   43.745      2 Template:Lamannia_picture\n 36.54%   42.833      2 Template:IsLamannia\n 35.66%   41.792      2 Template:IsSpeculation\n 34.77%   40.759      2 Template:InCategory\n 24.61%   28.846      1 Template:Mat\n 24.20%   28.369      4 Template:Popup\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key ddowiki:pcache:idhash:10189-0!canonical and timestamp 20260817224119 and revision id 634094. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>",
  "wikitext": "{{Named item|Quiver\n  | name                     = Quiver of Alacrity\n  | type                     = Thin Quiver\n  | minlevel                 = 0\n  | bind                     = {{Bind|BtC|BoA}}\n  | durability               = N/A\n  | material                 = None\n  | hardness                 = N/A\n  | cost                     = 500 pp\n  | weight                   = 1.00 lbs\n  | quest                    = Ascension Chamber\n  | chest                    = Raid Warded chest\n  | capacity                 = 3\n  | maxstack                 = 1,500\n  | enhancements             = \n* {{Alacrity|Ranged|10}}\n* {{UpgradeableItem|Black Abbot}}\n  | crafting                 = Fountain of Necrotic Might\n  | craftingupgrade          = <!-- as above -->\n  | description              = Said to allow the user to draw arrows or bolts at a very fast rate, this large, thin quiver will hold 3 different types of arrow or bolt and can store each type of up to 1500. Total capacity: 4500.\n  | pic                      = Quiver Generic Alacrity.png\n  | picdesc                  = Quiver of Alacrity.png\n  | icon pic                 = Icon Item Slot Quiver.png\n  | notes                    = '''TIP:''' This may cause your character overloaded because of the weight of bolts/arrows inside of the quiver when you are especially level-1 '''(* 4,500 arrows are 135 lbs)'''. Turning on the auto-collect function is not recommended. <br />\n{{Quote|developer=Feather_of_Sun|source={{Forums|p=4378420|display=0}}| quote= \nI worked with Genasi to design the upgrades for the Abbot and Reaver's Fate loot. Though not all of my ideas went through in their original form, as this was a team effort, the upgrade to the Quiver of Alacrity is exactly how I intended it to be.\n\nI know full well that it has no minimum level, and has never had one.\n\nWe're not planning on changing it, nor has the subject ever even come up.\n\nThe entire point of it is that the upgraded version of this item is a fantastic convenience to a TR who has put the work in to get and upgrade the quiver.}}\n}}",
